  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Back Better Secondary Education Systems in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support boosting foundational skills, increase capacity of teachers and strengthen assessment. This aims to improve learning outcomes, enhance student retention in secondary schools, especially for girls, strengthen data management and generate evidence to bolster the education system&#x2019;s overall efficiency and effectiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
